1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:14,879
Welcome to Update 10 of AHEAD Pathway. Your research notebook can now hold a conversation. When you share a note, you and the Director can think it through together, right there, under the note.

2
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:39,420
It starts in your notebook. Write as you always do: a reading, an idea, a day of work. When you want the Director's thinking on it, choose Share with the Director. The note is marked as shared, and a conversation opens beneath it. Everything you do not share stays private, and you can stop sharing at any time.

3
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:55,750
The Director reads your note and replies beneath it, so a question about a reading is answered with the reading in view. A new reply is marked New, and you answer right there, in the box underneath, as often as you need.

4
00:00:57,149 --> 00:01:07,849
You never have to go looking. Each of you is told, on your phone and in the app, the moment the other writes, and one tap takes you straight to the note.

5
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:21,819
On the Director's side, your reply arrives at once, marked New, with your whole note beside it. Nothing is lost in an inbox, and nothing waits for the next meeting.

6
00:01:23,219 --> 00:01:48,899
This is what makes it powerful. Supervision no longer waits for the next meeting. You can raise a question on the day you read, while the idea is still alive, and get guidance while you are still working on it. Every exchange stays with its note, so your notebook becomes a record of how your thinking developed, and it downloads with the notebook, as a Word document or a web page.

7
00:01:50,299 --> 00:02:02,529
Open your notebook today, share a note you are thinking about, and start the conversation. That is AHEAD Pathway: your degree, well supported, every step of the way.
